    "issue_alignment": "Compact sample size (stz2) box with field_size 4: stsz_box_read stores one or two 4-bit sample sizes per iteration and then increments i by 2, after which it updates max_size/total_size from ptr->sizes[i]. When the last pair (even sampleCount) or last entry (odd sampleCount) is processed, i is already sampleCount or sampleCount+1, so ptr->sizes[i] reads out of bounds past the sampleCount-entry array. A top-level stz2 box with sampleCount=2 and one byte of table data triggers the read of sizes[2]."
